 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・NC State（種）: 咲き終わった花房を取ると花期が延び、こぼれ種も防げる。冬に地際で刈る。種の文だけなので中。同じ種のほかの品種と同じ B。機械は空欄",
  "management_type_quote": "Remove faded flower panicles to prolong bloom period and to prevent unwanted self-seeding (cultivars generally do not come true from seed).",
  "management_type_by_matching": null,
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/同じ種の別品種（F05・F08）] 耐暑性；強（この品種のページはない。信頼度：低）\n[MBG/種] Needs good air circulation (space well and thin out stems as needed) to help combat potential powdery mildew problems.\n[NC State/種] Good air circulation (adequate spacing and thinning of stems as needed) will help combat powdery mildew.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 欧米の文献だけの耐暑性：言い回しの照合では 空欄、文を読み直して 中（[MBG・種] prefers climates with mild summers compared to very hot and humid conditions）\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の同じ種の品種の値を採った",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Removing faded flower panicles will ... prevent self-seeding（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Removing faded flower panicles will prolong blooming and prevent self-seeding as cultivars do not come true from seed.\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：空欄）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[読み直し 2026-11-24] 株立ちの記述だけで、広がる記述がない：[NC State・種] erect ... clump-forming",
